n AI agent that provides help to a sales representative as they prepare for customer meetings.",AzureAIAgentsText:"Azure AI agents",AzureAIContentUnderstandingText:"Azure AI Content Understanding",AzureAILanguageText:"Azure AI Language",AzureAIModelInferenceAPI:"Azure AI Model Inference API",AzureAIMultimodalDescription:"A creative writing assistant using Prompty and Azure OpenAI. Includes CI/CD, evaluation, tracing, monitoring, and experimentation.",AzureAIMultimodalText:"Multi-model orchestration",AzureAIRagStarterDescription:"A custom RAG application that implements a chat copilot using Prompty, Azure OpenAI, and Azure AI Search.",AzureAIRagStarterText:"Azure AI RAG Starter",AzureAISearchText:"Azure AI Search",AzureAIStarterDescription:"Jump right in with the essentials you need to build and deploy a chat app that uses models and prompts.",AzureAIStarterText:"Azure AI Starter",AzureAiServices:"Azure AI Services",AzureContainerAppsText:"Azure Container Apps",AzureContainerRegistryText:"Azure Container Registry",AzureCosmosDBText:"Azure Cosmos DB",AzureOpenAIText:"Azure OpenAI",AzureStorageAccountText:"Azure Storage Account",BasicChatAppDescription:"Create and deploy a basic chat application integrated with your data and telemetry insights using Azure Container Apps.",BasicChatAppText:"Get started with AI chat",BasicText:"Basic",BuildConversationalAgentDescription:"Leverage advanced conversational understanding to create and enhance chatbots and agents with deterministic and human-controllable workflows.",BuildConversationalAgentText:"Build your conversational agent",CarouselItemLabel:"{current} of {total}",GenerateDocumentFromDataDescription:"Accelerate generation of documents such as contracts, invoices and investment proposals by finding and summarizing relevant information from your data.",GenerateDocumentFromDataText:"Generate documents from your data",GetStartedWithAgentDescription:"Create and deploy a basic agent application with actions and telemetry insights using Azure Container Apps.",GetStartedWithAgentText:"Get started with AI agents",Ignite2025:{MoreButtonText:"Build with our quick-start solution templates",SubText:"Microsoft Foundry is built around you and your needs. It has never been easier to connect your applications and business systems with our latest technologies from Foundry Knowledge to Microsoft Fabric to Azure App Platform to built-in MCP tools or your own tools. Simply connect and get building."},IntermediateText:"Intermediate",MainHeader:"Quick-start templates for your AI solutions",ModernizeCodeWithAgentsDescription:"Migrate legacy code to modern languages by leveraging a team of agents.",ModernizeCodeWithAgentsText:"Modernize your code with agents",MoreButtonText:"Check out more templates",MultiModalContentProcessingDescription:"Process claims, invoices, contracts and other documents quickly and accurately by extracting information from unstructured content and mapping it to a structured format. This template supports text, images, tables and graphs.",MultiModalContentProcessingText:"Multi-modal content processing",NewLaunchRibbonText:"New launch",NextItemText:"Go to next",OpenInGithub:"Open in Github",PreviousItemText:"Go to previous",SemanticKernelText:"Semantic Kernel",StartHereRibbonText:"Start here",SubText:"Azure AI Foundry is built around you and your needs. It has never been easier to connect your applications with our latest technologies, from Azure AI Search to Microsoft Fabric to Azure Monitor and beyond. Simply connect and get building."},vL={BrowseButtonText:"Download the Azure AI Foundry SDK",Ignite2025:{BrowseButtonText:"Download the Microsoft Foundry SDK",ImageText:"Screenshots of the Microsoft Foundry SDK on GitHub and VS Code, showing example code in Python, JavaScript, C Sharp, and Rest.",SubText:"An easy-to-use, unified API and SDK allows you to build faster and smarter while getting you to production with confidence."},ImageText:"Screenshots of the Azure AI Foundry SDK on GitHub and VS Code, showing example code in Python, JavaScript, C Sharp, and Rest.",MainHeader:"Code with precision",SubText:"An easy-to-use, unified API and SDK allows you to build faster and smarter while getting you to production with confidence."},_L="Docs",fL={Ignite2025:{MainHeader:"The AI app and agent factory",SigninText:"Sign in to get started",SubText:"It’s never been easier to build, optimize, and govern AI apps and agents that understand your business context and deliver business impact. Our unified, interoperable AI platform enables developers to build faster and smarter, while organizations gain fleetwide security and governance in a unified portal."},MainHeader:"Create without boundaries",SigninText:"Sign in to get started",SubText:"Azure AI Foundry has everything you need to design, customize, and manage AI applications and agents built in GitHub, Visual Studio, Copilot Studio, and Microsoft Fabric with APIs for all your needs."},yL={AzureAiServices:"Azure AI Services",AzureCognitiveSearch:"Azure Cognitive Search",AzureCosmosDB:"Azure CosmosDB",AzureFunctions:"Azure Functions",AzureOpenAI:"Azure OpenAI",AzureStorage:"Azure Storage Account",Bing:"Bing",ContainerApps:"Container Apps",Fabric:"Fabric",Function:"Formulas",LogicApps:"Logic Apps",Meta:"Meta",SQL:"Azure SQL",SharePoint:"SharePoint"},bL="Model as a Service",AL={AgentsAltText:"Sample code for agents in Azure AI Foundry and a list of four features: model of your choice, grounded in knowledge, bring your own data, and equipped with actions.",AgentsDescription:"Automate business processes at scale.",AgentsDescriptionOld:"Securely automate your business processes at scale.",AgentsSlide:{Card1:"Model of your choice",Card2:"Grounded in knowledge",Card3:"Bring your own data",Card4:"Equipped with actions"},AgentsText:"Agents",AgentsTitle:"Orchestrate enterprise-ready agents",AgentsTitleOld:"Enterprise-ready agents",CarouselChangeAnnouncement:"Carousel slide {current} of {total}",CarouselItemLabel:"{current} of {total}",CarouselLabel:"Carousel of model features in Azure AI Foundry",CuratedAltText:"Example models in Azure AI Foundry, including OpenAI, Mistral, Meta, and HuggingFace.",CuratedDescription:"Leverage over 11,000 models from Azure OpenAI, Microsoft, DeepSeek, xAI, NVIDIA, Meta, and dozens of other model providers, all accessible via simple APIs so you always have the latest technology. ",CuratedDescriptionOld:"Leverage the latest GPT models from Azure OpenAI and dozens of other model providers, all accessible via simple APIs so you always have the latest technology.",CuratedText:"Curated",CuratedTitle:"Premier models",GovernAltText:"Example charts of Azure AI Foundry compliance features for data protection, privacy, and security practices.",GovernDescription:"Our products and solutions continue to comply with global data protection regulations. Microsoft will always be transparent about our privacy, safety, and security practices.",GovernText:"Govern",GovernTitle:"Compliance forward",Ignite2025:{AgentsAltText:"Example agent templates Microsoft Foundry, showing GitHub Insights & Code Avisor template and Morket Trends Researcher template.",AgentsDescription:"Streamline development using seamless hosting and integration of the most popular open-source agent frameworks. With a native IDE experience and broad language support, developers can move at the speed of AI with Microsoft Agent Framework, LangChain, CrewAI, and LlamaIndex.",AgentsText:"Agents",AgentsTitle:"Orchestrate AI apps and agents with open, flexible frameworks",CarouselLabel:"Carousel of model features in Microsoft Foundry",CuratedAltText:"Example models in Microsoft Foundry, including OpenAI, Mistral, and Meta.",CuratedDescription:"Access over 11,000 foundational, open, reasoning, multimodal, and industry-specific models from Azure OpenAI, Microsoft, DeepSeek, Grok, NVIDIA, Meta, and dozens of other providers. Instantly benchmark and compare models for your use case or enable intelligent model routing to optimize performance in real-time.",CuratedDescription2:"Access over 11,000 foundational, open, reasoning, multimodal, and industry-specific models from Azure OpenAI, Microsoft, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Grok, NVIDIA, Meta, and dozens of other providers. Instantly benchmark and compare models for your use case or enable intelligent model routing to optimize performance in real-time.",CuratedText:"Models",CuratedTitle:"The widest selection of models in the industry",CustomizeAltText:"Example of configuring an agent in Microsoft Foundry and connecting it to tools like MCP and Code Interpreter.",CustomizeDescription:"Customize and upgrade models with ease, empower agents to understand business context and enable AI to act on your business systems using pre-built and custom MCP tools.",CustomizeText:"Customize",CustomizeTitle:"Drive business results with action-oriented and context aware agents",ProtectAltText:"Example chart of Microsoft Foundry monitoring showing agent run volume over time.",ProtectDescription:"Gain fleet-wide monitoring and governance across the AI development lifecycle to  detect and mitigate harmful content and iteratively improve security, performance, costs, and governance with rich Microsoft Defender and Entra integration.",ProtectText:"Protect",ProtectTitle:"Defend and manage AI with a centralized control plane"},NextItemText:"Go to next",OptimizeAltText:"Example charts of usage and costs in Azure AI Foundry.",OptimizeDescription:"Azure AI Foundry surfaces real-time information and exposes simple levers so you can scale your application to meet your business's growing demands.",OptimizeText:"Optimize",OptimizeTitle:"Well informed. In control.",PreviousItemText:"Go to previous",ProtectAltText:"Example charts of Azure AI Foundry safety features for model coherence, groundness, relevance, and block rate.",ProtectDescription:"Azure AI Foundry provides APIs and controls that empower you to mitigate and safeguard against risks of AI generating harmful or disruptive outcomes.",ProtectText:"Protect",ProtectTitle:"Safety built in"},CL={AzureOpenAIPitch:"With Azure AI Foundry, you can unlock the power of AI, seamlessly integrated with the scale, reliability, and security of Microsoft Azure. We embed advanced models and tools directly into your existing workflows in GitHub, Visual Studio, Copilot Studio, and Microsoft Fabric. Now you can enhance your AI development with solutions that scale with your business.",Blocks:{HRBlock:{Content:"H&R Block unlocked organizational knowledge, empowering faster, more accurate client responses.",LogoAltText:"H&R Block"},KPMG:{Content:"KPMG optimized workflows, automating tasks and boosting efficiency across teams.",LogoAltText:"KPMG"},TomTom:{Content:"TomTom × AI has introduced an AI assistant for in-car digital cockpits while simplifying its mapmaking with AI.",LogoAltText:"TomTom"},Volvo:{Content:"VOLVO automated document processing, cutting down manual work and accelerating admin tasks.",LogoAltText:"Volvo"}},Ignite2025:{AzureOpenAIPitch:"With Microsoft Foundry, you can unlock the power of AI, seamlessly integrated with the scale, reliability, and security of Microsoft Azure. We embed advanced models, agents, and tools directly into your existing workflows in GitHub, Visual Studio, Copilot Studio, and Microsoft Fabric. Now you can enhance your AI development with solutions that scale with your business – wherever you build.",Blocks:{AudiAG:{Content:"AUDI AG launched secure, scalable AI assistants in just two weeks, enabling faster access to information to employees.",LogoAltText:"Audi AG"},Carvana:{Content:"Carvana built an AI-powered engine to analyze all customer interactions, cutting inbound calls per sale and streamlining the car buying experience.",LogoAltText:"Carvana"},Fujitsu:{Content:"Fujitsu automated sales proposal creation, boosting productivity and enabling teams to focus on strategic customer engagement.",LogoAltText:"Fujitsu"},KPMG:{Content:"KPMG used agenti