ng",ResponsibleAI:"Overview of Responsible AI practices in AI Foundry",SectionTitle:"Relevant resources"},Title:"Content filters help"},q6={OverviewSection:{LearnMore:"Learn more",SectionDescription:"Azure OpenAI provides access to OpenAI's models with the security and enterprise capabilities of Azure.",SectionTitle:"What is Azure OpenAI?"},ResourcesSection:{OpenAIHowTo:"Explore OpenAI how-to's",OpenAITutorials:"Explore OpenAI tutorials",QuickstartGuide:"Explore quickstart guides",SectionTitle:"Relevant resources"},Title:"Azure OpenAI help"},$6={Title:"Images playground"},Y6={AzureAIStudio:"Azure AI Foundry",AzureOpenAI:{BreadcrumbTitle:"Azure OpenAI",CommonExamplesTitle:"Try out common examples",Description:"Explore the generative AI models and craft unique prompts for your use cases.",GetAccessSection:{AdditionalResources:"Additional resources",AdditionalUseCases:"Additional use cases",ResponsibleAIModifications:"How to configure content filters",Title:"Get access to new features and capabilities"},GetStartedResources:{AddYourData:{Description:"Ground your own data on advanced AI models to create conversational copilots that aid user comprehension, task completion, and decision-making.",Title:"Bring your own data"},AssistantsCard:{Description:"Speed up development of GPT-powered Al Assistants with prebuilt conversation state management and customization tools.",Title:"Assistants playground"},ChatPlaygroundCard:{Description:"Design a customized Al assistant using ChatGPT. Experiment with GPT-3.5-Turbo and GPT-4 models.",Title:"Chat playground"},FineTuningCard:{Description:"Create a custom model by training it with your own data.",Title:"Fine-tuning"},ImagePlaygroundCard:{Description:"Generate unique images by writing descriptions in natural language.",Title:"Images playground"},TryItNow:"Try it now"},GetStartedTitle:"Get started",LearningResources:{DocumentationCard:{LinkTitle:"Documentation",Title:"Read our documentation"},MicrosoftQnACard:{LinkTitle:"Post a quest